    {
      "name": "dsh-skill-init",
      "title": {
        "en": "Skill Initializer",
        "zh": "Skill 初始化器"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Run /init in a project to set up Agent collaboration files, the knowledge base and code conventions: create or merge AGENT.md (entry index and feedback rules) plus a .kb/ skeleton (index/manifest/modules/decisions/changelog). manifest.json records the Git branch and commit. /init also generates a per-project code-style skill at .dsh/skills/code-style/ from the detected tech stack (summaries and per-chapter chunks of every Google Style guide, plus local formatter configs, never committed). skill_kb_check verifies consistency, skill_kb_record registers knowledge write-backs.",
        "zh": "通过 /init 在项目里初始化 Agent 协作所需的规则文件、知识库与代码规范：生成/合并 AGENT.md（入口索引与回灌规则）与 .kb/ 骨架（索引/manifest/模块/决策/回灌记录），manifest.json 记录 Git 分支与提交；按项目实际技术栈生成代码规范技能 .dsh/skills/code-style/（Google Style 全部指南的摘要 + 章节分块 + 本机格式化配置，不进版本库）；skill_kb_check 校验一致性，skill_kb_record 登记回灌。"
      },
      "icon": "icons/dsh-skill-init.svg",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/mistake52/dsh-private-pluginsmarket#readme",
      "repository": {
        "url": "https://github.com/mistake52/dsh-private-pluginsmarket",
